# App-facing public data surface. Unlike com.payabli.sdk.core.network.*, these types carry NO
# @RestrictTo: a host app catches PayabliException and reads PayabliErrorCode, so the annotation
# would make the app's own catch block a Lint RestrictedApi error.
#
# -keepnames, not -keep: name stability, not retention. Names must survive the app's own R8 run so a
# crash report names PayabliDeclineException rather than a.b.c.
#
# A single '*' does not cross the package separator, so a sub-package of core.model would need its own
# line here. Keep app-facing types flat in core.model instead.
-keepnames class com.payabli.sdk.core.model.* { *; }
